{"id":"7d011f131f5a8d4d","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness.md","title":"Self-Referential Correctness of a Modal System","display":"df-modal-self-referential-correctness — Self-Referential Correctness of a Modal System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness","aliases":["92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness"],"display":"df-modal-self-referential-correctness — Self-Referential Correctness of a Modal System","source":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-modal-letterless-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-self-referential-correctness — Self-Referential Correctness of a Modal System"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62ba454c37d12a16\" href=\"?note=62ba454c37d12a16\" title=\"92-df-modal-letterless-truth\">92-df-modal-letterless-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为上述模态系统之一；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_U^0\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_U^0\\)</span> 在 letterless 域定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SRC}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{SRC}(U)\\)</span> 为以下性质。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c908091e8e31a3b\" href=\"?note=4c908091e8e31a3b\" title=\"92-df-modal-language\">92-df-modal-language</a> 中不含命题变量的公式集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}self\\text{-}referential\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{SRC}(U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}\\;(U\\vdash X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}self\\text{-}referential\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{SRC}(U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}\\;(U\\vdash X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仅约束 letterless 定理。矛盾使系统证明底，而底是假，因此 SRC 蕴含一致性。若 X letterless 且 U 证明 Box X，SRC 使 Box X 真，定义给 U 证明 X；这是限制域上的元语言稳定性，不是可证反射模式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-modal-letterless-truth","status":"resolved","id":"62ba454c37d12a16","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-letterless-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-modal-language","status":"resolved","id":"4c908091e8e31a3b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}$ 是 [[92-df-modal-language]] 中不含命题变量的公式集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_U^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SRC}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}self\\text{-}referential\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{SRC}(U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}\\;(U\\vdash X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{True}_U^0(X)).","display":true}],"bytes":1236,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-letterless-truth]] → [[92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness]] → [[92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness]] → [[92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability]]。"},{"id":"9d01ba91fb099b79","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness]]"}],"outgoing":["62ba454c37d12a16","4c908091e8e31a3b"]}